          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_resolution_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>The frequency bin resolution is 1 / window length (s): 0.2 Hz with 5 s windows, 0.25 Hz with 4 s windows. The width of the mini bands must be a multiple of it: 0.2 Hz or 1 Hz with 5 s windows; 0.25 Hz, 0.5 Hz or 1 Hz with 4 s windows. IRASA and FOOOF are described in the documentation of the tool: Read more! below.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
